      <unit id="Dialog.ControlsInvalidNotification.Text">
        <segment >
          <source>XWVM has detected invalid control bindings for:
&lt;b&gt;{controls}&lt;/b&gt;
The default keyboard and mouse bindings will now be applied and saved unless you cancel. Controller bindings will not be affected.

&lt;b&gt;Continuing without applying default binding settings may affect critical game interactivity, and is not recommended.&lt;/b&gt;</source>
          <target>XWVM 偵測到下列無效的控制鍵綁定：
&lt;b&gt;{controls}&lt;/b&gt;
除非您取消，否則將套用並儲存預設鍵盤與滑鼠配置。控制器（搖桿）綁定不受影響。

&lt;b&gt;若不套用預設綁定設定直接繼續，可能會嚴重影響遊戲操作，不建議這麼做。&lt;/b&gt;</target>
        </segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="Dialog.ControlsInvalidNotification.Button.Cancel">
        <segment >
          <source>Cancel</source>
          <target>取消</target>
        </segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="Dialog.ControlsInvalidNotification.Button.ApplyDefaults">
