      <unit id="FolderSetup.HeaderText">
        <segment >
          <source>XWVM requires that you have a compatible game installed on your computer, and that you select the folder where it is installed.
When you select a folder with a valid installation of compatible game, it will be indicated at the right hand list.</source>
          <target>XWVM 需要您的電腦上已安裝相容的遊戲，並請選取其安裝資料夾。
當您選取包含相容遊戲有效安裝的資料夾時，右側清單將會予以標示。</target>
        </segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="FolderSetup.CDROMText">
        <segment >
          <source>If you have a retail version of a compatible game on CD-ROM, either insert the disk, or copy its content to a folder on your PC.</source>
          <target>若您持有 CD-ROM 光碟實體零售版的相容遊戲，請放入光碟，或將其內容複製到電腦中的資料夾。</target>
        </segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="Dialog.ControlsUnusableNotification.Text">
        <segment >
          <source>XWVM has detected invalid control bindings for:
&lt;b&gt;{controls}&lt;/b&gt;
The bindings will now be cleared and saved unless you cancel.

&lt;b&gt;Continuing without clearing these binding settings may affect critical game interactivity, and is not recommended.&lt;/b&gt;</source>
          <target>XWVM 偵測到下列無效的控制鍵綁定：
&lt;b&gt;{controls}&lt;/b&gt;
除非您取消，否則這些綁定將被清除並儲存。

&lt;b&gt;若不清除這些綁定設定直接繼續，可能會嚴重影響遊戲操作，不建議這麼做。&lt;/b&gt;</target>
        </segment>
      </unit>
      <unit id="Dialog.ControlsInvalidNotification.Button.ClearBindings">
        <segment >
          <source>Clear Bindings &lt;b&gt;({time})&lt;/b&gt;</source>
          <target>清除綁定 &lt;b&gt;({time})&lt;/b&gt;</target>
        </segment>
      </unit>
